        rdfs:comment                   "Silk programme on cream silk in blue typography with cream fringe applied all round.   Produced for 'A Programme by Command of Her Most Gracious Majesty the Queen', including 'Le Cid', a programme of music, cinematographe pictures, Monsieur Taffary's Calculating and Performing Dogs, and The Diamond Jubilee Procession, Windsor Castle, 23rd November 1897."@en ;
